<title>UK: June 4-6 Brent cargo kept by BP - trade.</title>
<headline>June 4-6 Brent cargo kept by BP - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sole Brent cargo nominated loading dates on Tuesday was kept voluntarily ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The June 4-6 cargo, which was deferred from Friday, was kept by British Petroleum (BP), they said.</p>
<p>Brent cargoes are traded on a paper, or forward market until the 1700 London time deadline on the nearest trading day 15 days before their assigned loading date.</p>
